<title>USA: GOLF-SCORES AT LPGA TOUR CHAMPIONSHIP AFTER THIRD ROUND.</title>
<headline>GOLF-SCORES AT LPGA TOUR CHAMPIONSHIP AFTER THIRD ROUND.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1996-11-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores at the</p>
<p>$700,000 LPGA Tour Championship after the third round Friday</p>
<p>on the par-72, 6,924-yard Desert Inn Golf Course (golfers U.S.</p>
<p>unless stated):</p>
<p>207 Karrie Webb (Australia) 69 70 68, Emilee Klein 69 68 70</p>
<p>210 Nancy Lopez  73 68 69, Brandie Burton 72 69 69, Laura</p>
<p>Davies (Britain) 69 70 71, Michelle McGann 68 71 71, Juli</p>
<p>Inkster 68 70 72</p>
<p>211 Pat Hurst 71 75 65, Kelly Robbins 70 70 71</p>
<p>213 Caroline Pierce (Britain) 71 72 70, Jane Geddes 68 74 71,</p>
<p>Penny Hammel 68 71 74</p>
</text>
